flowchart TD
    A[Create StockTransfer in source Shop] --> B[DRAFT]
    B --> C{Dispatch authorized by source employee?}
    C -- No --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Validate available stock; exclude reserved quantities]
    D --> E[Post TRANSFER_OUT movement; decrease source stock]
    E --> F[IN_TRANSIT; stock unavailable to both Shops]
    F --> G[Destination employee authenticates in destination Shop]
    G --> H[Count actual received quantities]
    H --> I[Post TRANSFER_IN; increase destination stock]
    I --> J{All dispatched quantity received?}
    J -- Yes --> K[RECEIVED]
    J -- No --> L[PARTIALLY_RECEIVED; remaining quantity stays in transit]
    L --> G
    B --> M[Cancel before dispatch]
    M --> N[CANCELLED; no stock movement]
